[{"id":7896698751,"node_id":"LE_lADOAjwLdc5XUKIazwAAAAHWrg9_","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/events/7896698751","actor":{"login":"Zac-HD","id":12229877,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjI5ODc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12229877?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zac-HD","html_url":"https://github.com/Zac-HD","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zac-HD/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zac-HD/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zac-HD/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zac-HD/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zac-HD/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zac-HD/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zac-HD/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zac-HD/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zac-HD/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2022-11-26T20:37:10Z","label":{"name":"type: bug","color":"fc2929"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/comments/1328242779","html_url":"https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/10533#issuecomment-1328242779","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/10533","id":1328242779,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAjwLdc5PK2Bb","user":{"login":"jayendra-patil33","id":43951088,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTUxMDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43951088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33","html_url":"https://github.com/jayendra-patil33","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-11-27T13:05:16Z","updated_at":"2022-11-27T13:05:16Z","body":"I think I might have figured out what the problem is.\r\n\r\nHere is a snippet from `def _repr_compare` function of `class ApproxNumpy`, there is a check for when the `other_value` (which is the divisor) is 0.0\r\nhttps://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest/blob/857e34ef8555c48cb5c44f143a0d6692efb6c60f/src/_pytest/python_api.py#L186-L195\r\n\r\nHere is a snippet from `def _repr_compare` function of `class ApproxMapping`, there is no such check for the case  when  `approx_value.expected` (which is the divisor) is 0.0\r\nhttps://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest/blob/857e34ef8555c48cb5c44f143a0d6692efb6c60f/src/_pytest/python_api.py#L268-L276\r\n\r\nHere is my suggested change\r\n```python\r\n         if approx_value != other_value:\r\n              max_abs_diff = max(\r\n                  max_abs_diff, abs(approx_value.expected - other_value)\r\n              )\r\n              if approx_value.expected == 0.0:\r\n                  max_rel_diff = math.inf\r\n              else:\r\n                  max_rel_diff = max(\r\n                      max_rel_diff,\r\n                      abs((approx_value.expected - other_value) / approx_value.expected),\r\n                  )\r\n              different_ids.append(approx_key)\r\n```\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/comments/1328242779/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jayendra-patil33","id":43951088,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTUxMDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43951088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33","html_url":"https://github.com/jayendra-patil33","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/comments/1364526016","html_url":"https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/10533#issuecomment-1364526016","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/10533","id":1364526016,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAjwLdc5RVQPA","user":{"login":"jayendra-patil33","id":43951088,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTUxMDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43951088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33","html_url":"https://github.com/jayendra-patil33","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayendra-patil33/gists{/gist_id